    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the discovery of the tablet of the Old Masters, the world has been caught in the winds of change, and the future is full of uncertainty. As a wandering artist, your journey leads you to a mystical valley. Will you find inspiration for your art there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valley of the Old Masters</strong> is an old-school action-adventure game. It features a cryptic world full of secrets to uncover, a mysterious backstory, and many challenges and puzzles to solve.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a mysterious valley.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ancient sketches and paintings. Be inspired by them and draw your own sketches to fill your sketchbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other wanderers who are just as lost as you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons filled with mysterious and cryptic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of the Old Masters. Who were they, and why did they disappear?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the discovery of the tablet of the Old Masters, the world has been caught in the winds of change, and the future is full of uncertainty. As a wandering artist, your journey leads you to a mystical valley. Will you find inspiration for your art there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valley of the Old Masters</strong> is an old-school action-adventure game. It features a cryptic world full of secrets to uncover, a mysterious backstory, and many challenges and puzzles to solve.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a mysterious valley.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ancient sketches and paintings. Be inspired by them and draw your own sketches to fill your sketchbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other wanderers who are just as lost as you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons filled with mysterious and cryptic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of the Old Masters. Who were they, and why did they disappear?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Valley of the Old Masters is a cryptic, old-school action-adventure game. You play as a wandering artist who mysteriously finds themselves in a faraway valley, seeking inspiration for their art. Will you uncover the inspiration you crave, or will the valley\u2019s mysteries consume you?",
